  "historyNote": "#1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84, EXPIRED 11-7-90 New. #5080, eff 2-22-91; rpld by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97 New. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
